  "transcript": {
    "origin": "provided_subtitles",
    "cues": [
      {"id": "CUE-001", "start": 0, "end": 2.78, "text": "我想知道网友怎么吐槽is二十六", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-001.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-001", "SHOT-002"]},
      {"id": "CUE-002", "start": 6.24, "end": 11.16, "text": "再问一个经典的弱智问题，高考满分只有七百五，要怎么考上九八五", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-002.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-003", "SHOT-004"]},
      {"id": "CUE-003", "start": 11.16, "end": 15.18, "text": "他也老实巴交的给我回答了，这就是夸克最新的深度搜索功能", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-003.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-004", "SHOT-005"]},
      {"id": "CUE-004", "start": 15.19, "end": 19.87, "text": "它和大部分ai搜索的工具都不同，不是机械的抓一堆关键词瞎搜", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-004.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-005", "SHOT-006", "SHOT-007"]},
      {"id": "CUE-005", "start": 19.87, "end": 24.55, "text": "也不会找一堆不靠谱的信息来应付你，而是会像人类专家一样先思考", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-005.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-007", "SHOT-008", "SHOT-009", "SHOT-010"]},
      {"id": "CUE-006", "start": 24.56, "end": 29.84, "text": "再搜索这期视频呢，我就教大家正确的使用夸克的深度搜索，我们来到夸克", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-006.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-010", "SHOT-011", "SHOT-012"]},
      {"id": "CUE-007", "start": 29.84, "end": 32.67, "text": "在这里选择深度搜索，然后就可以开始提问了", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-007.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-012"]},
      {"id": "CUE-008", "start": 32.68, "end": 37.08, "text": "刚才提了俩弱智问题，现在换一个正常点儿的，比如这两天有朋友问我", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-008.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-012"]},
      {"id": "CUE-009", "start": 37.08, "end": 41.47, "text": "如何把html格式的ppt转为ppt格式，以方便编辑", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-009.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-012"]},
      {"id": "CUE-010", "start": 41.48, "end": 45.71, "text": "就把这个问题发给他吧，你看他会像agent一样先规划几个搜索方向", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-010.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-012"]},
      {"id": "CUE-011", "start": 45.71, "end": 49.97, "text": "然后开始去找各种权威的渠道搜索信息，这是他最终给我的结果", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-011.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-012", "SHOT-013"]},
      {"id": "CUE-012", "start": 49.98, "end": 54.371, "text": "既给我推荐了简单的工具，也写了适合开发者的复杂代码，非常靠谱", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-012.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-013", "SHOT-014"]},
      {"id": "CUE-013", "start": 54.371, "end": 57.62, "text": "还有一个我个人很在意的能力，就是信息的权威性", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-013.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-014", "SHOT-015"]},
      {"id": "CUE-014", "start": 57.63, "end": 62.79, "text": "因为垃圾信息会破坏所有的搜索结果，而夸克对这方面把控得非常严格", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-014.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-015"]},
      {"id": "CUE-015", "start": 62.79, "end": 65.16, "text": "比如我问他猫咪突然呕吐了该怎么办？", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-015.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-015", "SHOT-016"]},
      {"id": "CUE-016", "start": 65.17, "end": 70.53, "text": "他一口气读了二十多篇宠物的专业论文，很快给了我一个让我松一口气的结果，对了", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-016.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-016"]},
      {"id": "CUE-017", "start": 70.53, "end": 73.15, "text": "如果你有图片编辑的需求，你也可以认给他", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-017.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-016", "SHOT-017"]},
      {"id": "CUE-018", "start": 73.16, "end": 78.16, "text": "比如这张图，我希望删掉背景里的人群，就这么简单的一句话，图片就p好了", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-018.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-017", "SHOT-018", "SHOT-019", "SHOT-020", "SHOT-021"]},
      {"id": "CUE-019", "start": 78.16, "end": 80.84, "text": "说真的，这才是真正意义上的ai搜索天花板", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-019.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-021"]},
      {"id": "CUE-020", "start": 80.85, "end": 84.94, "text": "它不仅有智商，更有搜赏，而且还免费，朋友们快去用吧", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-020.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-021"]}
    ]
  },
